        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Interesting Findings from the Table</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Calibri\", \"Carlito\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    color: #262626;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1024px;\n    height: 768px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f1f1f1;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* Header banner */\n  .banner {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 118px;\n    background: #8f8b88;\n    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(140,132,126,0.75), rgba(140,132,126,0.75));\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .banner .bg-note {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.0);\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    left: 20px;\n    width: 108px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n  .logo .placeholder-inner {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    border: none;\n  }\n  .banner-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 130px;\n    top: 12px;\n    text-align: right;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .banner-title .open {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .banner-title .discussion {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 46px;\n    color: #1f4e9c;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .banner-sub {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 12px;\n    top: 8px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Arial Narrow\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    text-align: left;\n    border-left: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\n    padding-left: 8px;\n  }\n  /* Watermark */\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 330px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 96px;\n    color: rgba(150,150,150,0.35);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    z-index: 5;\n  }\n  /* Content */\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 10;\n    padding: 26px 34px 0 34px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  .block {\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n  }\n  .highlight {\n    color: #e8983f;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .spacer-sm { height: 18px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder-inner\">[Logo: purple globe with temple silhouette]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"banner-title\">\n      <span class=\"open\">OPEN</span><br>\n      <span class=\"discussion\">DISCUSSION</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"banner-sub\">\n      DEVELOPING<br>\n      DIGITAL<br>\n      CREATIVE<br>\n      ECONOMY<br>\n      IN INDONESIA\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">Courtesy of NXTcon</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      Interesting Findings from the Table:\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      70 % of categories have Global Players,<br>\n      another 70 % contain Local Firms,<br>\n      and 40 % have Regional Companies.<br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">Any opportunity for Aggregation or Region-Focused plays?</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      Only News, Gaming, Online Retail, Rentals, Travel and Transportation have all three types: Local, Regional and Global players.<br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">Are these the Hottest Opportunities in Southeast Asia?</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      Communication, Search, Blogging, Music, Social Discovery, Events, and Business Networking only have Global or International Players.<br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">Are these the toughest nuts to crack, requiring real disruption or a vertical focus?</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      Community, Local Discovery, Ticketing, and Auto have only local players.<br>\n      <span class=\"highlight\">Is there an opportunity to aggregate these into a regional level platform?</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"block\">\n      There are no categories with only regional players\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
